1
00:00:01,710 --> 00:00:03,795
No way! I refuse to accept that!

2
00:00:03,878 --> 00:00:05,296
I don't understand.

3
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:07,966
Accept it or not, I am Ken Takakura.

4
00:00:09,342 --> 00:00:10,510
Stop it!

5
00:00:10,593 --> 00:00:11,678
I don't wanna hear it!

6
00:00:11,761 --> 00:00:13,054
Crap! The curse!

7
00:00:13,138 --> 00:00:15,765
Miss Ayase! Hurry! Your psychic powers!

8
00:00:15,849 --> 00:00:18,727
Lemme gobble that weenie!

9
00:00:28,153 --> 00:00:30,947
Th-Thank you very much.

10
00:00:32,532 --> 00:00:34,284
Let's set a few rules.

11
00:00:34,993 --> 00:00:36,703
No speaking your name.

12
00:00:38,121 --> 00:00:39,080
Okay.

13
00:00:51,259 --> 00:00:54,220
Because you like the occult,
you're Okarun.

14
00:00:54,304 --> 00:00:56,139
O-Okarun?

15
00:00:57,265 --> 00:00:59,434
If you use that name, I'll kill you.

16
00:01:00,018 --> 00:01:03,313
"That name"? It's my own name.

17
00:01:04,689 --> 00:01:08,234
Well, I guess I have no choice,
so that's fine.

18
00:01:08,318 --> 00:01:11,237
You don't seem that upset about it,
Okarun!

19
00:01:11,321 --> 00:01:13,656
What? This is against my will!

20
00:01:13,740 --> 00:01:15,366
Hey, lemme see your face!

21
00:01:17,077 --> 00:01:20,455
You're looking happy, Okarun!

22
00:01:26,795 --> 00:01:28,338
Stinky!

23
00:01:28,421 --> 00:01:31,257
You farted in front of my face!
You're the worst!

24
00:01:31,341 --> 00:01:34,469
It's because you're
putting pressure on me, Miss Ayase!

25
00:01:36,137 --> 00:01:38,932
Hold on a sec! It's already morning!

26
00:01:39,849 --> 00:01:42,811
That means Turbo Granny
won't come out anymore?

27
00:01:43,394 --> 00:01:45,355
Huh? Is that true?

28
00:01:46,397 --> 00:01:48,900
I mean, ghosts show up at night, right?

29
00:01:50,151 --> 00:01:52,362
Why don't you come to my place for now?

30
00:01:54,072 --> 00:01:55,657
That outfit…

31
00:01:57,075 --> 00:01:58,785
is scarier than a ghost.

32
00:03:40,220 --> 00:03:43,473
{\an8}My Grandma's really hard on guys,
so be careful.

33
00:03:43,556 --> 00:03:45,516
{\an8}She almost killed a previous boyfriend.

34
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:47,977
Huh? You wait till now to say that?

35
00:03:54,359 --> 00:03:55,693
What's going on?

36
00:04:03,534 --> 00:04:05,453
Okarun! Are you okay?

37
00:04:12,252 --> 00:04:13,378
Must be this.

38
00:04:13,461 --> 00:04:14,837
Sorry, Okarun!

39
00:04:14,921 --> 00:04:16,756
A barrier's been put up!

40
00:04:20,635 --> 00:04:22,512
I thought I was gonna die.

41
00:04:26,391 --> 00:04:28,309
Okay, now try coming in!

42
00:04:28,393 --> 00:04:30,436
Is it really gonna be okay?

43
00:04:30,520 --> 00:04:33,648
If you burn, I'll toss you
into the river again, so it's okay.

44
00:04:54,711 --> 00:04:56,379
Whoa. Freaky.

45
00:04:56,462 --> 00:04:58,214
You're safe!

46
00:04:59,382 --> 00:05:00,383
How do you feel?

47
00:05:00,466 --> 00:05:01,759
Any changes?

48
00:05:01,843 --> 00:05:04,429
My entire body tingles.

49
00:05:04,512 --> 00:05:07,390
More like, what's with your head?

50
00:05:07,473 --> 00:05:10,018
Totally hilarious! It's a granny perm!

51
00:05:11,936 --> 00:05:13,730
Freaky! What are you laughing about?

52
00:05:13,813 --> 00:05:16,190
I was about to die there!

53
00:05:18,776 --> 00:05:20,194
Grandma!

54
00:05:21,988 --> 00:05:24,115
Huh? Grandma's not here.

55
00:05:24,741 --> 00:05:26,826
Oh well. Come on up.

56
00:05:28,328 --> 00:05:30,204
E-Excuse me.

57
00:05:37,003 --> 00:05:38,171
Hold on a minute.

58
00:05:38,254 --> 00:05:40,173
I'll change clothes, so close the door.

59
00:05:40,256 --> 00:05:41,924
Oh, okay.

60
00:05:46,429 --> 00:05:48,473
Miss Ayase! The curse!

61
00:05:48,556 --> 00:05:50,933
Hey! Don't just open the door!

62
00:05:52,310 --> 00:05:53,644
Face the wall!

63
00:05:55,646 --> 00:05:56,856
STAY OUT

64
00:05:56,939 --> 00:05:59,567
I-I'm sorry.

65
00:05:59,650 --> 00:06:02,528
Sheesh, what a pain.

66
00:06:21,756 --> 00:06:23,716
Okarun, put these on.

67
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:26,094
It's ladieswear but it should be okay.

68
00:06:26,177 --> 00:06:27,512
Sorry to trouble you.

69
00:06:28,679 --> 00:06:31,349
By the way, you don't have
anything down there, do you?

70
00:06:32,558 --> 00:06:34,393
What? What do you mean?

71
00:06:35,353 --> 00:06:37,355
I'm sorry! I didn't look!

72
00:06:37,438 --> 00:06:38,898
It's fine now.

73
00:06:45,071 --> 00:06:46,531
Hey, hey.

74
00:06:50,159 --> 00:06:51,744
Show me what's down there.

75
00:06:51,828 --> 00:06:56,082
Turbo Granny was saying that you're cursed
because your weenie has been taken.

76
00:06:59,001 --> 00:07:00,128
It's gone!

77
00:07:00,211 --> 00:07:04,090
What? No way!
What's it look like? Show me!

78
00:07:04,173 --> 00:07:06,634
I can't show you! Are you stupid?

79
00:07:06,717 --> 00:07:08,261
But there's nothing there, right?

80
00:07:08,344 --> 00:07:10,888
The issue isn't whether or not it's there!

81
00:07:10,972 --> 00:07:12,682
Man, you're so cheap.

82
00:07:12,765 --> 00:07:14,642
This is the worst!

83
00:07:14,725 --> 00:07:16,310
What are we gonna do about this?

84
00:07:16,394 --> 00:07:17,478
It's not there!

85
00:07:17,562 --> 00:07:19,772
Don't make it sound like I'm the villain.

86
00:07:19,856 --> 00:07:21,983
You're the one who challenged me!

87
00:07:22,066 --> 00:07:22,942
Huh?

88
00:07:23,025 --> 00:07:26,612
I wasn't interested
in your occult stories to begin with!

89
00:07:26,696 --> 00:07:29,824
I only picked a fight
because you kept talking to me!

90
00:07:34,454 --> 00:07:37,331
I didn't want to miss my chance.

91
00:07:38,916 --> 00:07:42,670
I've always wanted a friend.

92
00:07:44,797 --> 00:07:48,384
<i>So I thought,</i>
<i>I didn't want to miss this chance.</i>

93
00:07:50,178 --> 00:07:53,431
<i>That's why I so desperately</i>
<i>started talking to you.</i>

94
00:07:53,514 --> 00:07:57,852
UAP AND UFO
U.S MILITARY SECRETS REVEALED!!

95
00:08:00,521 --> 00:08:01,647
But in the end…

96
00:08:02,398 --> 00:08:05,860
You live in a different world, Miss Ayase.

97
00:08:06,569 --> 00:08:09,739
You're not someone that a person like me
should be talking to.

98
00:08:11,032 --> 00:08:12,408
I'm so sorry…

99
00:08:13,242 --> 00:08:15,620
that I roped you into so much danger.

100
00:08:16,704 --> 00:08:20,625
When this is all over,
you can just ignore me again.

101
00:08:21,792 --> 00:08:24,587
That's the annoying part about you.

102
00:08:24,670 --> 00:08:29,133
You assume how others feel
and jump to conclusions without asking.

103
00:08:29,217 --> 00:08:33,638
The reason you don't have friends
is because you shove them away.

104
00:08:39,894 --> 00:08:42,563
Don't say that I can ignore you.

105
00:08:42,647 --> 00:08:45,233
We can just talk about
the occult like normal.

106
00:08:52,698 --> 00:08:55,368
Hey, say something.

107
00:08:55,993 --> 00:08:57,036
Poke, poke.

108
00:09:01,332 --> 00:09:02,542
You're so ugly!

109
00:09:02,625 --> 00:09:03,584
Huh?

110
00:09:03,668 --> 00:09:05,711
What did you just say, punk?

111
00:09:05,795 --> 00:09:07,838
You are completely tactless, Miss Ayase!

112
00:09:07,922 --> 00:09:09,924
You bluntly recite people's weaknesses!

113
00:09:10,007 --> 00:09:12,468
What the hell is tact?

114
00:09:15,388 --> 00:09:18,099
Perhaps your grandmother is back?

115
00:09:18,182 --> 00:09:20,017
Shh! Stay quiet.

116
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:22,562
I've never heard a doorbell like this.

117
00:09:23,271 --> 00:09:24,855
What do you mean?

118
00:09:24,939 --> 00:09:26,983
Grandma told me in the past…

119
00:09:27,066 --> 00:09:29,443
that we have two doorbells.

120
00:09:30,027 --> 00:09:31,988
One is for humans,

121
00:09:32,071 --> 00:09:33,489
and the other is for…

122
00:09:33,990 --> 00:09:35,491
evil spirits.

123
00:09:35,575 --> 00:09:38,119
Crap!
It's because I took that talisman off!

124
00:09:39,161 --> 00:09:41,080
<i>It's okay if it's for a little bit, right?</i>

125
00:09:44,959 --> 00:09:45,876
Oh, no!

126
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:48,546
There's something out there!
What are we gonna do?

127
00:09:48,629 --> 00:09:50,298
I'll put the talisman back up!

128
00:09:50,381 --> 00:09:52,466
If it's an evil spirit,
it'll burn up like you did, right?

129
00:09:52,550 --> 00:09:54,468
Are you going to burn me, too?

130
00:09:54,552 --> 00:09:57,179
You can just get outside of our plot!

131
00:09:57,263 --> 00:10:01,517
Please wait to put up the talisman
until I step outside!

132
00:10:04,687 --> 00:10:07,189
It's gone. Where did it go?

133
00:10:07,273 --> 00:10:09,066
Miss Ayase! Look at this!

134
00:10:18,117 --> 00:10:19,535
Crap! Crap!

135
00:10:19,619 --> 00:10:21,495
We gotta leave the plot now!

136
00:10:21,579 --> 00:10:22,872
Go that way! Hurry!

137
00:10:22,955 --> 00:10:24,665
-Miss Ayase!
-What?!

138
00:10:26,083 --> 00:10:27,251
We can't get out.

139
00:10:30,129 --> 00:10:32,340
We're trapped inside by a wall.

140
00:10:32,423 --> 00:10:34,550
The torii gate! I can attach the talisman!

141
00:10:34,634 --> 00:10:36,969
Please wait!
You can't put the talisman up!

142
00:10:37,053 --> 00:10:38,262
Why not?

143
00:10:38,346 --> 00:10:40,514
The torii gate is embedded into the wall!

144
00:10:40,598 --> 00:10:43,601
We can't leave the plot like this!

145
00:10:43,684 --> 00:10:44,935
What should we do?

146
00:10:45,019 --> 00:10:47,063
If we don't do anything, we're seriously…

147
00:10:50,316 --> 00:10:51,484
What is this?

148
00:10:55,237 --> 00:10:56,989
We're in serious trouble!

149
00:10:57,073 --> 00:10:58,449
Miss Ayase!

150
00:11:03,245 --> 00:11:05,122
Help… me…

151
00:11:05,206 --> 00:11:07,708
Okarun, are you okay?
Get a grip on yourself!

152
00:11:08,459 --> 00:11:09,835
Blood!

153
00:11:16,133 --> 00:11:18,969
Black fog. So it's because of that.

154
00:11:29,230 --> 00:11:33,776
Found… you…

155
00:11:35,778 --> 00:11:42,410
You are evil people.
You broke the promise.

156
00:12:27,788 --> 00:12:29,999
Give me…

157
00:12:30,958 --> 00:12:35,254
your banana!

158
00:12:38,299 --> 00:12:40,593
Crap! What's with that evil spirit?

159
00:12:41,135 --> 00:12:43,679
Wait, you have another one down there?

160
00:12:44,263 --> 00:12:45,556
Of course not!

161
00:12:45,639 --> 00:12:46,974
That's an alien!

162
00:12:47,057 --> 00:12:47,892
Huh?

163
00:12:47,975 --> 00:12:50,269
There's no doubt about it! That collar!

164
00:12:50,352 --> 00:12:52,354
That's a Flatwoods Monster!

165
00:12:52,438 --> 00:12:56,150
They were first witnessed in a town
in America called Flatwoods.

166
00:12:56,233 --> 00:12:58,569
In Japan,
they've been sighted in Yamanashi.

167
00:12:58,652 --> 00:13:01,405
They're known as
"aliens who are three meters tall."

168
00:13:01,947 --> 00:13:03,741
Then what was that doorbell?

169
00:13:03,824 --> 00:13:07,411
You're saying a chime specifically
for ghosts reacted to an alien?

170
00:13:07,495 --> 00:13:09,497
There are studies that say people

171
00:13:09,580 --> 00:13:12,958
who see spiritual phenomena
often see UFOs as well!

172
00:13:18,088 --> 00:13:22,092
In other words, there might be something
in common between ghosts and aliens!

173
00:13:22,176 --> 00:13:25,971
Is that a buddy of the aliens
from yesterday? They're so persistent!

174
00:13:26,055 --> 00:13:28,224
If we don't hurry up and do something
about that thing,

175
00:13:28,307 --> 00:13:30,184
the poison fog will kill us!

176
00:13:30,267 --> 00:13:34,104
But if I'm holding Okarun's curse back,
I can't use my psychic powers well.

177
00:13:34,188 --> 00:13:35,523
Miss Ayase.

178
00:13:49,370 --> 00:13:51,080
Sheesh, what a pain!

179
00:13:56,835 --> 00:13:58,212
Huh?

180
00:13:58,295 --> 00:13:59,713
Sheesh!

181
00:14:21,110 --> 00:14:21,986
Miss Ayase.

182
00:14:22,069 --> 00:14:23,737
What is it now?

183
00:14:24,989 --> 00:14:26,574
I will fight.

184
00:14:27,700 --> 00:14:29,326
Please release the curse!

185
00:14:29,410 --> 00:14:30,953
What's this so suddenly?

186
00:14:31,036 --> 00:14:33,080
I'm not afraid of aliens!

187
00:14:33,664 --> 00:14:37,877
Can you release just the physical curse
while keeping my head in check?

188
00:14:50,306 --> 00:14:54,643
You make it sound easy, but I haven't
learned how to control this power!

189
00:14:54,727 --> 00:14:57,688
If all goes well, we might be able
to control that Granny's powers!

190
00:14:57,771 --> 00:14:59,857
I'm not sure if I can do it right!

191
00:14:59,940 --> 00:15:01,275
Please try!

192
00:15:15,289 --> 00:15:18,792
{\an8}-Miss Ayase! Here it comes!
-Give it to me!

193
00:15:18,876 --> 00:15:20,544
Please hurry!

194
00:15:36,894 --> 00:15:38,103
This is amazing.

195
00:15:38,187 --> 00:15:40,564
I'm brimming with power!

196
00:15:41,607 --> 00:15:43,192
But I'm totally depressed.

197
00:15:43,275 --> 00:15:45,402
Whoa! Is his psyche broken?

198
00:15:45,486 --> 00:15:48,364
My conscious is clear, yo…

199
00:15:48,447 --> 00:15:50,616
But I totally have the blues, yo…

200
00:15:50,699 --> 00:15:53,035
What's with that manner of speech?

201
00:15:53,118 --> 00:15:54,536
Oh, sorry.

202
00:15:54,620 --> 00:15:56,622
I am an awkward fellow after all, yo…

203
00:15:57,414 --> 00:15:59,583
I told you not to say that!

204
00:15:59,667 --> 00:16:01,251
I should just, yo…

205
00:16:01,335 --> 00:16:03,504
Eradicate myself, yo?

206
00:16:03,587 --> 00:16:06,799
Stop talking like that! It pisses me off!

207
00:16:06,882 --> 00:16:09,760
I'll be back in a little bit.

208
00:16:09,843 --> 00:16:12,554
I'm sure it won't work, yo…

209
00:16:12,638 --> 00:16:13,514
Hey!

210
00:16:13,597 --> 00:16:15,891
Look ahead! In front of you!

211
00:16:21,730 --> 00:16:24,817
My body moved outta reflex.

212
00:16:25,734 --> 00:16:28,862
So this is Turbo Granny's powers?

213
00:16:28,946 --> 00:16:30,239
I feel so dejected.

214
00:16:33,993 --> 00:16:36,370
So fast. When'd he learn to do that?

215
00:16:39,999 --> 00:16:42,626
This is amazing! Maybe we can do this!

216
00:16:50,300 --> 00:16:52,803
Wait, what's going on?

217
00:16:59,476 --> 00:17:00,728
Okarun!

218
00:17:05,190 --> 00:17:06,900
Give it to me!

219
00:17:06,984 --> 00:17:08,110
Crap!

220
00:17:12,531 --> 00:17:13,866
Okarun, are you okay?

221
00:17:13,949 --> 00:17:15,826
I'm sorry, Miss Ayase!

222
00:17:15,909 --> 00:17:19,079
My body can't keep up
with the power of the curse!

223
00:17:19,163 --> 00:17:22,541
My entire body feels like
it's going to burst into a million pieces!

224
00:17:22,624 --> 00:17:25,252
This isn't a speed
that humans can move in!

225
00:17:25,335 --> 00:17:29,339
But I've only damaged
five fingers from that thing!

226
00:17:29,423 --> 00:17:31,884
How the hell are we gonna defeat
something like that?

227
00:17:31,967 --> 00:17:34,011
Like I know! Don't get pissed at me!

228
00:17:34,094 --> 00:17:37,598
If we knew how to defeat it,
we wouldn't be struggling!

229
00:17:41,518 --> 00:17:42,770
That thing…

230
00:17:43,687 --> 00:17:45,189
Is it sumo wrestling?

231
00:17:45,689 --> 00:17:46,899
Come again?

232
00:17:46,982 --> 00:17:51,820
If we can get its hand
to touch the ground, maybe we win?

233
00:17:51,904 --> 00:17:54,531
Miss Ayase, are you a genius?

234
00:17:54,615 --> 00:17:55,783
I knew I was.

235
00:17:55,866 --> 00:17:58,368
Next time is my limit, okay?

236
00:17:59,536 --> 00:18:01,330
Okarun, aim for the legs.

237
00:18:01,413 --> 00:18:04,208
I'll make the thing trip
with my psychic powers!

238
00:18:04,291 --> 00:18:06,251
Man, I'm so depressed.

239
00:18:06,335 --> 00:18:10,089
We have to get a bit closer,
so you have to back me up!

240
00:18:10,172 --> 00:18:11,840
What a pain.

241
00:18:11,924 --> 00:18:15,177
Give me your banana!

242
00:18:21,183 --> 00:18:22,601
I can't take it anymore!

243
00:18:22,684 --> 00:18:24,478
Hold back the curse with my right hand,

244
00:18:24,561 --> 00:18:26,772
and I'll take on this guy
with my left hand!

245
00:18:26,855 --> 00:18:28,816
What a pain!

246
00:18:28,899 --> 00:18:29,858
Oh, hold on.

247
00:18:29,942 --> 00:18:31,110
Sorry, Okarun!

248
00:18:36,156 --> 00:18:38,283
All right! The hand is melting!

249
00:18:38,367 --> 00:18:40,244
Just like how we planned!

250
00:18:45,749 --> 00:18:46,875
You're kidding.

251
00:18:46,959 --> 00:18:48,335
Miss Ayase, run for it!

252
00:18:58,303 --> 00:18:59,346
Miss Ayase!

253
00:19:02,766 --> 00:19:05,394
Crap. This is bad news.

254
00:19:08,397 --> 00:19:09,606
I'm back.

255
00:19:09,690 --> 00:19:13,277
Sheesh. You really are a nuisance.

256
00:19:15,362 --> 00:19:17,531
Hey, sumo alien!

257
00:19:18,365 --> 00:19:21,201
You put your hand on the ground.

258
00:19:21,285 --> 00:19:23,245
That's cheating, you scumbag.

259
00:19:23,328 --> 00:19:24,329
Miss Ayase!

260
00:19:24,413 --> 00:19:26,623
Please release the curse one more time!

261
00:19:26,707 --> 00:19:29,293
I don't care what happens to my body!

262
00:19:29,376 --> 00:19:32,004
I'm gonna beat the crap outta this thing!

263
00:19:32,087 --> 00:19:33,755
You sit and watch, Okarun!

264
00:19:33,839 --> 00:19:37,718
I can't let cheaters off the hook!

265
00:19:37,801 --> 00:19:40,012
Wait, what are you saying?

266
00:19:40,095 --> 00:19:44,558
You really pissed me off, wimpy alien.

267
00:19:47,895 --> 00:19:49,521
Stop it!

268
00:19:49,605 --> 00:19:52,482
That did nothing!

269
00:19:52,566 --> 00:19:56,403
Please release my curse, Miss Ayase!
I'm begging you!

270
00:19:56,486 --> 00:19:59,489
If this keeps up, you'll die!

271
00:20:00,115 --> 00:20:02,701
This is fine.

272
00:20:03,785 --> 00:20:06,121
This depth is great.

273
00:20:08,290 --> 00:20:10,667
Because if I'm in this deep…

274
00:20:10,751 --> 00:20:14,630
it means I'm outside of the torii gate!

275
00:20:34,358 --> 00:20:36,276
PEACEFUL PROSPEROUS FAMILY
WARD AGAINST EVIL AND MISFORTUNE

276
00:20:58,674 --> 00:21:00,133
We're back.

277
00:21:03,011 --> 00:21:04,471
We're saved.

278
00:21:05,889 --> 00:21:09,059
Okarun! We're back! See?

279
00:21:10,185 --> 00:21:11,186
Oh, yes.

280
00:21:13,563 --> 00:21:16,733
I really thought I was gonna die!

281
00:21:16,817 --> 00:21:18,819
Oh! Miss Ayase, the curse!

282
00:21:18,902 --> 00:21:21,321
Come on! Don't be a pain!

283
00:21:21,405 --> 00:21:24,074
At least let me indulge in the moment!

284
00:21:24,157 --> 00:21:27,828
You say that, but I can't
do anything about this.

285
00:21:27,911 --> 00:21:30,497
What? You change your hairdo?

286
00:21:30,580 --> 00:21:32,124
Of course not!

287
00:21:32,207 --> 00:21:37,170
{\an8}That kinda looks good.
I did prefer the granny perm, though.

288
00:21:37,254 --> 00:21:39,298
{\an8}But you made fun of it!

289
00:21:39,381 --> 00:21:43,093
Huh? I'm kinda dizzy.

290
00:21:43,176 --> 00:21:44,303
Oh, crap.

291
00:21:44,386 --> 00:21:45,220
Huh?

292
00:21:45,304 --> 00:21:46,179
Miss Ayase?

293
00:21:46,263 --> 00:21:48,515
Get a hold of yourself! Miss Ayase!

294
00:23:44,089 --> 00:23:46,591
<i>In 1952, several boys and soldiers,</i>
<i>as well as their pet dog,</i>

295
00:23:46,675 --> 00:23:48,510
<i>encountered the Flatwoods Monster.</i>

296
00:23:48,593 --> 00:23:50,762
<i>The granny perm</i>
<i>was better on you after all.</i>

297
00:23:50,846 --> 00:23:52,055
<i>Are you listening to my story?</i>

298
00:23:52,139 --> 00:23:54,558
<i>Next episode,</i>
<i>"It's a Granny vs. Granny Clash!"</i>

299
00:23:54,641 --> 00:23:57,519
<i>They're called "aliens who are</i>
<i>three meters tall" in Japan.</i>
